# Dublin Core Elements 1.1 -- the real, standard vocabulary
# (http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/), not a project invention. Declared here
# (class + rdfs:label only, same minimal-stub approach as rico-vocabulary.ttl)
# because the National Archives of Maldives' "Bulk Upload Spreadsheet" --
# the CSV format used to submit material to their Eternal digital archive --
# uses exactly these 15 elements as column headers (Title, Subject,
# Description, Creator, Publisher, Contributor, Date, Type, Format,
# Identifier, Source, Language, Relation, Coverage, Rights). Using the real
# DC terms for these columns, rather than inventing RiC-O-shaped
# equivalents, keeps the imported catalogue data standards-compliant and
# means it means the same thing to any other tool that also speaks DC.
#
# RiC-O has its own closer-fitting properties for some of these concepts
# (e.g. rico:title, rico:hasCreator linking to a real Agent individual
# rather than a bare literal) -- CatalogueImportService uses those instead
# of the DC equivalent wherever RiC-O has one, and falls back to the DC
# property only for the columns RiC-O has no direct equivalent for
# (Subject, Publisher, Contributor, Source, Relation, Coverage, and a plain
# literal Format/Type/Date/Rights alongside their richer RiC-O/OAIS
# counterparts). See CatalogueImportService for the exact column-by-column
# mapping.

@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dc:   <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> .

dc:title       a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "Title" .
dc:subject     a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "Subject" .
dc:description a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "Description" .
dc:creator     a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "Creator" .
dc:publisher   a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "Publisher" .
dc:contributor a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "Contributor" .
dc:date        a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "Date" .
dc:type        a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "Type" .
dc:format      a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "Format" .
dc:identifier  a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "Identifier" .
dc:source      a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "Source" .
dc:language    a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "Language" .
dc:relation    a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "Relation" .
dc:coverage    a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "Coverage" .
dc:rights      a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "Rights" .
